WEBVTT

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:41.580
A Makai Knight.

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:50.130
So this is the power that I have inherited.

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:52.430
A destiny to protect the people...

00:00:52.430 --> 00:00:56.300
That is so, Silver Makai Knight Zanga.

00:00:57.370 --> 00:00:58.900
Yasusuke.

00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:00.700
So you are a Makai Knight as well.

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:02.100
How heartening!

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:03.540
Heartening?

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:07.240
You and I have become comrades.
From now on, the two of us...

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:09.910
Don't be mistaken, Raiko.

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:12.410
I listen to no one.

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:17.090
I will use this armor, this power, by my own choice.

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:20.590
I will continue doing what I want on my own.

00:01:20.590 --> 00:01:25.130
Wait! That power is not for yourself, but for the people.

00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:26.800
That's enough, Raiko.

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:30.980
What have you been doing with this power until now?!

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:32.570
For the people?

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:34.000
Look at the capital,

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:38.610
it's no different from before I became a thief!

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:41.780
I don't plan on taking things easy like you.

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:45.110
Hey, don't insult Raiko-<i>sama</i> any further!

00:01:45.110 --> 00:01:50.750
That's big talk from a petty thief who knows nothing of knights.

00:01:52.450 --> 00:01:56.760
You're the one who speaks too much, little girl.

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:59.630
You must be the Madou tool that accompanies him.

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:03.830
This man was accepted by the armor and is my master.

00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:07.030
He is the one who inherits the name Zanga!

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:12.940
Why not come with me?

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:15.680
Let the past stay in the past.

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:18.480
I've become quite the popular one...

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:21.280
Return to the Light Palace.

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:26.880
As a thief, how long do you think it will take to realize your dream?

00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:29.820
Fine.

00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:49.840
<i>A seal guarded since ancient times</i>

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:57.920
<i>Now it falls and turns to thorns</i>

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:05.160
<i>Remnants of resentment brought to</i> <i>life by the darkness of night take breath</i>

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:14.190
<i>What does that pyre desire</i> <i>and why does it beckon</i>

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:23.550
<i>The flowers of darkness</i> <i>that fear and hate the light</i>

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:31.350
<i>Rakshasa, who dances</i> <i>wrapped in a cloak of blood</i>

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:39.280
<i>Release and call back the golden armor</i>

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:49.290
<i>The blade, which can cut</i> <i>through inevitable destiny</i>

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:55.440
<i>Night of the crimson moon</i>

00:03:52.640 --> 00:04:00.010
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:05.010
"CONFLICT"

00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:13.930
What do you think?

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:16.500
With this finished, we will no longer need to worry

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:21.300
of sickness and evil spirits when the Rajou Gate crumbles.

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:23.530
We will not know until we use it.

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:25.610
Do not worry.

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:28.180
This gate, with Haruaki-<i>dono</i>'s barrier,

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:30.750
as well as the strength of the police magistrate,

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:32.910
assures the security of the Light Palace!

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:34.280
In the end,

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:39.800
everything goes to the best <i>onmyouji</i> of the Heian period, Abeno Haruaki.

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:49.000
Though I am quite envious of your upcoming retirement.

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:50.770
Is there a problem?

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:53.500
No, it's nothing.

00:05:10.550 --> 00:05:13.150
That was delicious!

00:05:13.150 --> 00:05:15.060
I'm glad you enjoyed it.

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:19.660
More importantly, don't come over every single day to eat for free!

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:24.570
Why not? It's too much trouble to cook.

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:25.330
"She tried."

00:05:25.730 --> 00:05:27.290
"And it upset her stomach."

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:36.380
What have you been doing until now?!

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:42.010
You're not going to eat?

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:47.090
Don't surprise me like that! I could have died!

00:05:47.090 --> 00:05:51.390
What are you thinking with that face as blank as a <i>kamaboko</i>?

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:52.230
<i>K-Kamaboko</i>?

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:55.760
Ooh, are you starting to get interested in girls?

00:05:55.760 --> 00:05:57.770
I can teach you anytime, you know.

00:05:57.770 --> 00:05:59.320
Stop it!

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:05.110
It looks like you have gotten stronger since we last spoke.

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:07.210
It has been a long time.

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:11.380
Yes. Yasusuke, I do not want to dance around the subject.

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:13.880
Lend me your strength.

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:16.920
What do you wish from a thief like me?

00:06:16.920 --> 00:06:19.620
Become a warrior of the Light Palace

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:22.390
and eliminate the Horrors that threaten the capital.

00:06:22.390 --> 00:06:23.790
The capital...

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:27.760
Do you not mean the things that threaten you?

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:28.900
Yasusuke!

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:31.370
Making such a huge gate...

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:36.800
Aren't the people of the Light Palace just protecting themselves?

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:41.210
Even without your orders,
I will eliminate every single Horror!

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:43.340
That is my duty.

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:48.380
So there is no need to follow under you.

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:49.720
Yasusuke!

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:54.420
No matter who it is, as long as they are human I will protect them!

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:57.660
You must be crazy, acting in such a way before Michinaga-<i>sama</i>!

00:06:57.660 --> 00:07:00.160
Brother, were you able to save face this way?

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:01.430
Don't speak.

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:06.100
I remember why we considered you a criminal in the first place!

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:08.230
Makai Knight, huh?

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:11.270
I refuse!

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:14.110
No matter how many times you ask, I won't remove the seal.

00:07:14.110 --> 00:07:18.450
There's got to be more that I can do! Lives I can save!

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:19.510
In order for that...

00:07:19.510 --> 00:07:22.850
You're being swayed by that petty thief.

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:25.250
I will be sure to control my power.

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:26.950
It's impossible. Give it up.

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:30.260
Either way, it's impossible to save everyone.

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:32.790
That's why we Makai Knights exist.

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:34.960
Talking like a big shot!

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:37.630
You just need to listen to me!

00:07:37.630 --> 00:07:40.330
I am not your pet!

00:07:43.840 --> 00:07:46.840
R-Raiko-<i>sama</i>, you shouldn't...

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:48.310
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:07:48.310 --> 00:07:51.840
Goodness. He is so troublesome!

00:07:57.690 --> 00:08:00.660
What's the point of working under Michinaga?

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:03.220
Nothing will change that way.

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:05.060
Yasusuke-<i>dono.</i>

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:07.830
Hey, Yorinobu. It's been a while.

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:09.400
How foolish.

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:12.030
It's a bad idea to go against Michinaga-<i>sama.</i>

00:08:12.030 --> 00:08:13.800
It seems you have yet to be deterred.

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:16.300
Oh? Why do you think that?

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:19.040
Who doesn't think it to be so?

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:21.380
If the Light Palace changes,

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:24.580
the pain and sadness of the poor will lessen.

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:28.650
I do not believe that will solve everything.

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:33.280
Even so, how can I stand aside and do nothing?

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:39.160
Come out.

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:40.830
You found me out!

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:42.530
There's no need to worry about me.

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:45.360
I cannot agree in this case!

00:08:46.570 --> 00:08:48.600
Will you spar with me then?

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:51.340
Of course! Anytime!

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:54.070
Why doesn't she trust me?!

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:56.840
That is not the case!

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:59.380
That is how special you are to her.

00:08:59.380 --> 00:09:02.280
Both the Golden Armor and you, Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:04.340
Just whose side are you on?!

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:23.440
"Is Raiko all right?"

00:09:20.300 --> 00:09:22.140
We'll just have to believe in him.

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:24.140
Well, Kintoki is with him, too.

00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:26.000
"Are you all right, Seimei?"

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:27.870
Huh?

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:36.550
Everything has fallen into place.

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:40.890
The fall of the Raise Gate will be the perfect chance.

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:45.460
They all believe that the gate will protect them,

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:49.100
unaware that it is the gate to their destruction.

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:54.840
It is the perfect cover, but the key is what happens right after.

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:57.970
The light of the capital will turn to darkness.

00:09:57.970 --> 00:10:00.170
But will they really move as you say?

00:10:00.170 --> 00:10:05.680
Do not worry, just move as planned.

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:07.510
--Go.
--Yes.

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:11.450
The dice are already in my hands

00:10:11.450 --> 00:10:14.150
and the result is already predetermined.

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:29.400
So I thought you, Izumi Shikibu-<i>san</i>, would...

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:31.570
Izumi-<i>chan</i>!

00:10:31.570 --> 00:10:34.440
...Izumi-<i>chan</i>, would know.

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:37.970
A method to remove not a curse, but a seal.

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:39.970
That's outside my area of expertise.

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:42.640
Why don't you ask Seimei?

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:44.850
Has Seimei come by here?

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:46.410
So she hasn't come home.

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:47.950
Yes. Well...

00:10:47.950 --> 00:10:50.120
Would you like me to give her a message if she comes?

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:52.710
No. Please don't tell her I visited.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:57.790
That stupid Raiko!

00:10:57.790 --> 00:11:02.130
It looks like he's quite troubled.
He had such a fragile expression.

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:05.200
He's too tied down by his duty!

00:11:05.200 --> 00:11:08.940
I don't really understand, but is that a bad thing?

00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:13.310
A knight is human, too.
They have the right to live as any other.

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:15.510
Are you saying he needs to take things easier?

00:11:15.510 --> 00:11:19.950
He tightens the noose around his own neck for others.

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:23.280
Who knows when he'll stop breathing.

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:27.120
Raiko doesn't understand the weight of his own life.

00:11:30.360 --> 00:11:40.000
Lost within my thoughts, fireflies seem my forlorn soul, leaving my body.

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:47.510
If you worry, even fireflies seem like your soul, wandering away from you.

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:51.750
Yes. Without the soul a human will just be an empty vessel.

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:54.520
You should tell him your feelings.

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:56.420
Otherwise, Raiko may not be the only one

00:11:56.420 --> 00:11:58.920
who may have the fireflies of his soul leave him.

00:11:58.920 --> 00:12:00.220
Oh, be quiet!

00:12:00.220 --> 00:12:02.020
He won't listen even if
I say anything, so I keep quiet!

00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:04.860
And I don't mind fireflies, they're not b-b-b-butter...

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:06.060
Butterflies?

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:07.260
Don't say the word!

00:12:07.260 --> 00:12:10.730
That's fine, but pay up for the poem.

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:12.760
No way!

00:12:17.070 --> 00:12:19.590
"Raise Gate"

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:27.080
You all have done well.

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:31.450
At tomorrow's inauguration,
Abeno Haruaki-<i>dono</i> will come to place the barrier

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:35.390
and the Raise Gate will be complete!

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:36.620
Such undeserved words.

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:40.430
Protecting the capital and our families from disaster,

00:12:40.430 --> 00:12:43.130
I cannot think of a more honorable task.

00:12:43.130 --> 00:12:47.030
Yes, Michinaga-<i>sama</i> would like to say a few words.

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:48.560
The greater good.

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:53.740
Haruaki, show them just once.

00:12:53.740 --> 00:12:57.880
The preparations are not yet complete!

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:00.920
It does not matter, just for a moment.

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:02.710
I understand.

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:20.000
How dazzling...

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:22.560
With this, the capital is safe!

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:31.610
That is the most I can do tonight.

00:13:31.610 --> 00:13:33.910
How impressive, Haruaki-<i>dono.</i>

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:37.150
Now, everyone. Let us celebrate tonight.

00:13:44.930 --> 00:13:48.800
I won't let things remain like this, Abeno Haruaki!

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:52.100
It seems that Michinaga only relies on Haruaki.

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:54.300
Wh-Who is it?!

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:55.500
You are...

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:58.940
At this rate, the name of the Kamono family will fall.

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:00.010
Silence!

00:14:00.010 --> 00:14:05.550
You must hate Haruaki.
That hatred can become your strength.

00:14:05.550 --> 00:14:11.020
Not only Haruaki, you can become something that surpasses all <i>onmyouji.</i>

00:14:11.020 --> 00:14:12.690
Sh-Shut up! Be silent!

00:14:12.690 --> 00:14:15.820
The Raise Gate is finished.

00:14:15.820 --> 00:14:18.560
Is that your work?

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:22.330
Wasn't that gate an eyesore to you as well?

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:26.570
Kamono Yasunori, how will you leave that name behind in this world?

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:29.170
With prestige? With embarrassment?

00:14:29.170 --> 00:14:34.180
Hatred is power.
Hate Haruaki with all your might!

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:36.040
That bastard, Haruaki!

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:39.340
I'll show him my strength!

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:42.730
Such excellent words!

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:49.920
Wait!

00:14:49.920 --> 00:14:55.230
My spell will let you pass through the barrier of the Light Palace.

00:14:55.230 --> 00:14:59.930
Then you can eat the people of the palace all you wish.

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:04.200
Of course, that hateful Haruaki as well.

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:16.850
Raiko-<i>sama</i>, I-look!

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:18.880
What is that?

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:21.880
What is that?!

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:28.690
Fire!

00:15:32.730 --> 00:15:35.540
It is dangerous here, you must return to the Light Palace.

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:39.210
Michinaga-<i>sama</i>, I will stay behind and protect the Raise Gate.

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:40.800
I will allow it.

00:15:41.740 --> 00:15:44.410
Get as far away as possible! Hurry!

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:50.720
Hang in there! It'll be all right!

00:15:54.460 --> 00:15:55.490
Brother!

00:15:55.490 --> 00:15:57.120
Be careful, Yorinobu.

00:15:57.120 --> 00:15:59.560
Wh-What the heck is that?!

00:16:00.590 --> 00:16:02.600
Please save us!

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:06.150
That is the gate that will protect the capital and our families!

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:07.600
Stop!

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:12.240
Kintoki. Yorinobu. Help as many people as you can escape.

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:13.970
I'll save the people trapped inside.

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:14.610
That's reckless!

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:17.780
That's right! You need your armor!

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:19.370
This is my duty.

00:16:24.020 --> 00:16:26.990
Ashiya Douman! Is this your doing?!

00:16:26.990 --> 00:16:30.020
The feast of darkness begins.

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:32.760
Kintoki, no matter what, don't worry about me.

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:34.160
Save as many people as you can.

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:35.690
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:16:36.700 --> 00:16:39.630
It is not yet time for us to play.

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:46.470
Kintoki!

00:16:52.480 --> 00:16:53.970
You've come.

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:57.990
What's all this ruckus about?

00:16:57.990 --> 00:16:59.220
Seimei!

00:16:59.220 --> 00:17:02.120
Leave that cracked face to me.

00:17:07.860 --> 00:17:11.530
Such an irritating light, no matter how often I see it!

00:17:12.230 --> 00:17:13.960
Go, Raiko.

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:23.900
Everyone, take this chance to escape!

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:27.040
Shit! There's no end to it!

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:33.900
Why isn't he fighting back?

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:41.700
As usual, such an undependable knight.

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:43.600
I should whip him into shape.

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:49.770
Raiko, stop Douman!

00:17:49.770 --> 00:17:51.200
Got it!

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:03.050
Thank goodness you are safe.

00:18:03.050 --> 00:18:03.850
Yes.

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:05.410
Please go inside.

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:09.890
Close the gates!

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:16.650
I have to stop that thing.

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:32.470
You cannot escape these.

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:45.760
Seimei...

00:18:45.760 --> 00:18:47.820
Stay there and watch.

00:18:51.570 --> 00:18:53.130
Douman!

00:18:53.130 --> 00:18:55.600
Let's bring things to an end.

00:18:58.910 --> 00:19:01.180
He's gotten stronger.

00:19:01.180 --> 00:19:02.940
I played around too much!

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:22.920
Let's finish things.

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:25.800
This is the end.

00:19:27.330 --> 00:19:29.330
Raiko!

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:38.780
Douman, you bastard!

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:43.320
At this rate, your dear Raiko will die.

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:47.690
However, if you save Raiko, the people will die.

00:19:47.690 --> 00:19:53.190
You must give up on one.
What a difficult choice...

00:19:53.190 --> 00:19:56.560
Isn't it, Seimei?

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:01.560
Seimei...

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:06.510
S-Save the people...

00:20:09.240 --> 00:20:12.180
Raiko-<i>sama</i>?

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:13.740
Kiyome!

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:23.760
Raiko!

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:25.920
Don't!

00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:54.590
How could this happen?!

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:12.610
<i>Illusions of darkness</i> <i>reflect where there is light</i>

00:21:12.610 --> 00:21:19.670
<i>The way of the current world is so fleeting</i>

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:26.750
<i>The fluttering butterfly that</i> <i>is drowning within your dreams</i>

00:21:26.750 --> 00:21:33.660
<i>Will only disappear if you</i> <i>reach out gently to touch it</i>

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:37.260
<i>The dancing of the glowing flames (sweetly)</i>

00:21:37.260 --> 00:21:40.730
<i>The flower-like music (far away)</i>

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:43.840
<i>The elegance of the moon</i>

00:21:43.840 --> 00:21:46.470
<i>Warmth that does not return (gently)</i>

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:51.140
<i>Hold me (look for the light of twilight)</i>

00:21:51.140 --> 00:21:58.150
<i>Dance up high, passing</i> <i>everything down the family crest</i>

00:21:58.150 --> 00:22:04.630
<i>The heart you want to protect</i> <i>even to the end of all memory</i>

00:22:04.630 --> 00:22:11.870
<i>Dance and bloom proudly,</i> <i>these lights that call each other</i>

00:22:11.870 --> 00:22:15.170
<i>Will overlap and shine again</i>

00:22:15.170 --> 00:22:22.870
<i>These crimson flowers</i> <i>of oath that drift to and fro</i>

00:22:29.350 --> 00:22:31.890
Are you all right?

00:22:31.890 --> 00:22:33.880
Why did you save me?

00:22:36.620 --> 00:22:39.830
How many people died?

00:22:39.830 --> 00:22:42.300
Answer me, Seimei!

00:22:42.300 --> 00:22:45.000
I told you that we can't save everyone.

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:47.900
Those were lives we could have saved!

00:22:47.900 --> 00:22:50.170
Just how much will you make me suffer?!

00:22:50.170 --> 00:22:50.800
I--!

00:22:50.800 --> 00:22:55.710
At that moment, you chose me and let those people die.

00:22:55.710 --> 00:22:57.870
You and I killed those people!

00:23:00.810 --> 00:23:02.250
This is the end.

00:23:06.190 --> 00:23:09.720
The things you love shine, huh?

00:23:09.720 --> 00:23:11.260
Douma Houshi.

00:23:11.260 --> 00:23:18.870
But, do you think that man will continue to work with you now?

00:23:18.870 --> 00:23:21.600
I see. That's how it was.

00:23:21.600 --> 00:23:25.240
You wanted to separate Raiko and I to seal away the Golden Knight.

00:23:25.240 --> 00:23:27.710
Was that your plan?!

00:23:27.710 --> 00:23:32.840
Can you still see the light, Seimei?

00:23:43.890 --> 00:23:46.520
Raiko...

00:23:51.070 --> 00:24:01.080
"Next Episode: SEIMEI"

00:23:52.530 --> 00:23:55.100
Within the pitch-black darkness,

00:23:55.100 --> 00:23:58.870
the starlight of dawn will guide you.
